/*
 * Southern defense tower basement —
 * west of stower_enter.
 *
 * Strategy A FluffOS room. Original
 * (leave_tower / search_dirt, CheckOpening
 * nightday, west stower2, south stower3,
 * east stower_enter) is stower1_ldmud.lpc.
 * Look-ats only: leave / search / chain
 * machinery / raise/lower / climb are not
 * loaded. Frozen: CheckOpening as day
 * (light through the opening). Later
 * AddVItem machine/wheel overwrite the
 * earlier pair. Archive keeps “it's
 * northeastern”, “It's purpose”, “would
 * be in big trouble”, “noone felt
 * responsible”, “int othe opening”,
 * “next to the the exit”. East
 * stower_enter and west stower2 are
 * loaded; south stower3 is not.
 */

